'Defines the main function of the program'
Function main

'Turns on the robot motors'
Motor On

'Calls the function to pick up an object'
Call pick1

'Calls the function to place the object at drop position 1'
Call drop1

'Calls the function to pick up an object'
Call pick1

'Calls the function to place the object at drop position 2'
Call drop2

'Calls the function to pick up an object'
Call pick1

'Calls the function to place the object at drop position 3'
Call drop3

'Turns off the robot motors'
Motor Off

'Ends the main function'
Fend


'Defines the function to turn on the gripper'
Function gripperon

'Activates output 11 to close the gripper and grip the object'
On 11

'Ends the gripper-on function'
Fend


'Defines the function to turn off the gripper'
Function gripperoff

'Deactivates output 11 to open the gripper and release the object'
Off 11

'Ends the gripper-off function'
Fend


'Defines the function to pick up an object from the pickup position'
Function pick1

'Moves the robot to the home reference position'
Go home_ref

'Opens the gripper before approaching the object'
Call gripperoff

'Waits for 1 second'
Wait 1

'Sets the robot movement speed to 70%'
Speed 70

'Moves the robot to the pickup approach position'
Go pick_apprch1

'Reduces the robot movement speed to 30%'
Speed 30

'Moves the robot to the actual pickup position'
Move pick_pt1

'Waits for 1 second to ensure the robot reaches the pickup position'
Wait 1

'Closes the gripper to grip the object'
Call gripperon

'Waits for 2 seconds to ensure the object is securely gripped'
Wait 2

'Sets the robot movement speed to 30%'
Speed 30

'Moves the robot 15 mm upward along the Z-axis using a point offset with respect to the world frame'
Move pick_pt1 +Z(15)

'Ends the pickup function'
Fend


'Defines the function to place the object at drop position 1'
Function drop1

'Sets the robot movement speed to 70%'
Speed 70

'Moves the robot to the first drop approach position'
Go drop_apprch1

'Reduces the robot movement speed to 30%'
Speed 30

'Moves the robot to the first drop position'
Move drop_pt1

'Waits for 1 second to ensure the robot reaches the drop position'
Wait 1

'Opens the gripper to release the object'
Call gripperoff

'Waits for 2 seconds to ensure the object is released'
Wait 2

'Sets the robot movement speed to 30%'
Speed 30

'Moves the robot 15 mm upward along the Z-axis using a point offset with respect to the world frame'
BMove XY(0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0)


'Ends the first drop function'
Fend


'Defines the function to place the object at drop position 2'
Function drop2

'Sets the robot movement speed to 70%'
Speed 70

'Moves the robot to the second drop approach position'
Go drop_apprch2

'Reduces the robot movement speed to 30%'
Speed 30

'Moves the robot to the second drop position'
Move drop_pt2

'Waits for 1 second to ensure the robot reaches the drop position'
Wait 1

'Opens the gripper to release the object'
Call gripperoff

'Waits for 2 seconds to ensure the object is released'
Wait 2

'Sets the robot movement speed to 30%'
Speed 30

'Performs a 15 mm positive Z-axis offset with respect to the tool frame using TMove'
TMove XY(0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0) 'Tmove Here +Z(15)' "Move drop_pt2 - TLZ (50)"


'Ends the second drop function'
Fend


'Defines the function to place the object at drop position 3'
Function drop3

'Sets the robot movement speed to 70%'
Speed 70

'Moves the robot to the third drop approach position'
Go drop_apprch3

'Reduces the robot movement speed to 30%'
Speed 30

'Moves the robot to the third drop position'
Move drop_pt3

'Waits for 1 second to ensure the robot reaches the drop position'
Wait 1

'Opens the gripper to release the object'
Call gripperoff

'Waits for 2 seconds to ensure the object is released'
Wait 2

'Sets the robot movement speed to 30%'
Speed 30

'Moves the robot 15 mm upward along the Z-axis using a point offset with respect to the world frame'
Move drop_pt3 +Z(15)

'Sets the robot movement speed to 70%'
Speed 70


'Moves the robot back to the home reference position'
Go home_ref


'Ends the third drop function'
Fend
